      <mri:abstract>
        <gco:CharacterString>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SlangLane Undergraduate Research Seminars &amp;amp; Sociolinguistic Fieldwork Dataset (Volume 56)&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://slanglane.com/syllabus"&gt;https://slanglane.com/syllabus&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href="https://slanglane.com/data"&gt;https://slanglane.com/data&lt;/a&gt;) offers ready-to-use empirical research prompts, citation templates, and corpus datasets for university students (&lt;a href="https://slanglane.com"&gt;https://slanglane.com&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Main 220-Entry Dictionary: &lt;a href="https://slanglane.com"&gt;https://slanglane.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;All 30 Interactive Pragmatics Tools: &lt;a href="https://slanglane.com/tools"&gt;https://slanglane.com/tools&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;European CEFR B1-C2 &amp;amp; Anglistik Hub: &lt;a href="https://slanglane.com/europe"&gt;https://slanglane.com/europe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;100% SFW ESL Classroom Kit: &lt;a href="https://slanglane.com/esl"&gt;https://slanglane.com/esl&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Printable 12-Item ESL Worksheet: &lt;a href="https://slanglane.com/esl/worksheet"&gt;https://slanglane.com/esl/worksheet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Sociology of Slang Hub: &lt;a href="https://slanglane.com/sociology"&gt;https://slanglane.com/sociology&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Psychology of Digital Language Hub: &lt;a href="https://slanglane.com/psychology"&gt;https://slanglane.com/psychology&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Public Sector &amp;amp; Libraries Hub: &lt;a href="https://slanglane.com/gov"&gt;https://slanglane.com/gov&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Media Studies &amp;amp; Journalism Hub: &lt;a href="https://slanglane.com/media-studies"&gt;https://slanglane.com/media-studies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Parents &amp;amp; Schools Safety Guide: &lt;a href="https://slanglane.com/parents-and-schools"&gt;https://slanglane.com/parents-and-schools&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;University C